+- Moving a member (`POST /projects/{pid}/members/{uid}/move`) removes the user
+  from the project in the path and adds them to `toProjectId` with the same
+  role. The actor must be a manager of both projects. The source project must
+  be readable (404 otherwise); the target must exist, be in the actor's
+  organization and be readable by the actor (404 otherwise); a readable project
+  where the actor is not a manager → 403; an archived source or target → 409.
